<h1>Subscription canceled</h1>
<p>Hi, {{name}}.</p>
{{#if endsAt}}
<p>Your <strong>{{plan}}</strong> subscription on <strong>{{appName}}</strong> was canceled. Nothing else will be charged, and you keep Pro until <strong>{{endsAt}}</strong>.</p>
{{else}}
<p>Your <strong>{{plan}}</strong> subscription on <strong>{{appName}}</strong> has ended, and nothing else will be charged.</p>
{{/if}}
<p>If you want to come back, just subscribe again on your plan page.</p>
{{> button url=billingUrl label="See my plan"}}
